roboparty-rp-server (1.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add AT+RESET command: clear motor errors, zero gamepad axes and
    buttons, stop running policy. Response: +RESET: OK|FAIL.
  * Add JoyDriver.reset() to zero all axes and release buttons.
  * Add rp_server.btwifi: Bluetooth (RFCOMM/SPP) WiFi provisioning
    service with systemd unit rp-btwifi.service.

